extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LLkkOBFUEP0Q7kNvwGBK_m0&_nc_oc=AdqsapdRp3LM4OWwW-D45-bUaJyxV24gckpmT-2ykm2dKRd2f7sdEaQH6mXtu6buRlk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLENDhAVUH6NIiLbj-yJo3EzLy0rLWbaSGXKVrWFrmzSw&oe=6AB69156"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kXVzhHCueoQQ7kNvwGBE0n2&_nc_oc=Adql944RlrXA1aIT1WqC-j5PX04vYEe71tBe2mQZSKsEJY9nPF5Q02e7huRKls70MU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLfbrxkKbUOSszTYW6JmpSfPe87fGhFQVhiHwaB92OvkA&oe=6AB698A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z--rercnrMMQ7kNvwF6y9XE&_nc_oc=AdpIHhU0J4B8n7zMLkgFLJ88DhtNHA1xNKp2i7ARwtjAiFpKKRefwDG086O9LkGFHVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJK7SX2Fqcj171pfEpr35JOj_Jbu1KuUl4zWEF5z3hMWw&oe=6AB66859"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":